./xmodel/grok-nfd-review.md:16:- Claim: H8 equal quotient requires `v_p(P_0^{(1)} Π_1) = v_p(P_0^{(2)} Π_2)` for every prime `p`. Letter domains pin those valuations, they mismatch on all three td-11 packets (including the empty stack), so `S=∅` and `D=0`. “This kills deep neutrals at td-11 outright.” Gate D2/D3/D4.
