uf24 t^24 + uf30 t^30 (prefix arc through d0 = 1).  With
f - a = c_f t^-12 Phi (1+O(t^42)), g = c_g t^-18 Gamma (1+O(t^42)),
J(f,g) = 1 is EXACTLY

  (t Phi_t - 12 Phi) Gamma_eta - Phi_eta (t Gamma_t - 18 Gamma)
      = -(42/(c_f c_g)) t^20.                                    (J)

